1
00:00:00,096 --> 00:00:02,096
(Sheldon:)Thank you for letting me stay here.

2
00:00:02,766 --> 00:00:05,766
(Penny:)Oh. You're welcome, sweetie.

3
00:00:09,648 --> 00:00:12,108
(Sheldon:)Okay, I'm sleepy now. Get out.

4
00:00:22,661 --> 00:00:25,541
(Sheldon:)Oh, good, you're finally home.

5
00:00:25,705 --> 00:00:27,415
(Leonard:)What were you doing at Penny's?

6
00:00:27,582 --> 00:00:31,502
Well, we had dinner, played some games,
and then I spent the night.

7
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:32,920
(Raj:)Oh.

8
00:00:33,088 --> 00:00:36,338
(Sheldon:)You'll be happy to know that I now
have a much better understanding...

9
00:00:36,508 --> 00:00:38,038
...of "friends with benefits."

